# <%= projectName %>

This project was generated with [Nx](https://nx.dev) and [Ionic](https://ionicframework.com/).

## Development server

Run `nx serve <%= projectName %>` for a dev server. Navigate to http://localhost:4200/. The app will automatically reload if you change any of the source files.

## Build

Run `nx build <%= projectName %>` to build the project. The build artifacts will be stored in the `www/` directory.

## Running tests

Run `nx test <%= projectName %>` to execute the unit tests.

Run `nx e2e <%= projectName %>` to execute the end-to-end tests.

## Capacitor

<% if (capacitor) { %>This project includes Capacitor for native functionality.

### Add a platform

Run `nx cap-add <%= projectName %>` to add a native platform (iOS or Android).

### Build for native

Run `nx cap-build <%= projectName %>` to build the app for native platforms.

### Open in IDE

Run `nx cap-open <%= projectName %>` to open the native IDE (Xcode for iOS, Android Studio for Android).

### Sync

Run `nx cap-sync <%= projectName %>` to sync web assets and native plugins.
<% } %>

